+\[
+\max\{R_{c_0},R_{c_1}\}\ge N\frac{c_0(c_1-c_0)}{c_1}
+\]
+against comparator suprema. The coefficient is maximized at \(c_0=1/2,c_1=1\), giving the existing \(1/4\) constant.
